{"sha": "46631405d77d3f36242573b571610862cc6d79c5de11c966b3bcef11745fa1f4", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:curves} 章 --- 曲线}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:1}", "$\\gamma'(t) = (1 - \\cos t,\\ \\sin t)$，于是", "\\[", "\\norm{\\gamma'(t)}^2 = (1 - \\cos t)^2 + \\sin^2 t", "= 2 - 2\\cos t = 4\\sin^2\\tfrac t2 ,", "\\]", "且 $\\norm{\\gamma'(t)} = 2\\sin\\frac t2$（在 $[0,", "2\\pi]$ 上非负）。由此可得", "\\[", "L = \\int_0^{2\\pi} 2\\sin\\tfrac t2\\,\\dd t", "= \\Bigl[-4\\cos\\tfrac t2\\Bigr]_0^{2\\pi} = 8 :", "\\]", "摆线的一拱长为 $8$（轮子半径为", "$1$）--- 这是雷恩的一个著名结果，其中不出现 $\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:2}", "设 $x = a\\cos t$，$y = b\\sin t$，则 $x' = -a\\sin t$，$y' = b\\cos", "t$，$x'' = -a\\cos t$，$y'' = -b\\sin t$，由", "\\cref{prop:b2:curves:kappaformula}可得", "\\[", "\\kappa(t)", "= \\frac{x'y'' - y'x''}{(x'^2 + y'^2)^{3/2}}", "= \\frac{ab\\sin^2 t + ab\\cos^2 t}", "       {(a^2\\sin^2 t + b^2\\cos^2 t)^{3/2}}", "= \\frac{ab}{(a^2\\sin^2 t + b^2\\cos^2 t)^{3/2}} .", "\\]", "分母在 $\\sin t = 0$ 时取最小值（值为 $b^3$，点为", "$(\\pm a, 0)$），在 $\\cos t = 0$ 时取最大值（值为 $a^3$，点为", "$(0, \\pm b)$）。由 $a > b$，可知 $\\kappa$ 在", "长轴端点处取最大值 $\\kappa_{\\max} = a/b^2$，并在", "短轴端点处取最小值 $\\kappa_{\\min} = b/a^2$：椭圆", "在长轴端点处弯曲得最厉害。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:3}", "对图像 $\\gamma(x) = (x, \\cosh x)$，有 $\\norm{\\gamma'(x)} =", "\\sqrt{1 + \\sinh^2 x} = \\cosh x$，于是从 $0$ 到 $x$ 的弧长", "为 $\\int_0^x \\cosh u\\,\\dd u = \\sinh x$。图像的曲率", "由\\cref{prop:b2:curves:kappaformula}给出：", "\\[", "\\kappa(x) = \\frac{f''(x)}{(1 + f'(x)^2)^{3/2}}", "= \\frac{\\cosh x}{\\cosh^3 x} = \\frac{1}{\\cosh^2 x} ,", "\\]", "故 $R(x) = \\cosh^2 x$，与所述一致。值得注意的是", "$R(x) = 1 + s(x)^2$，其中 $s = \\sinh x$ 为弧长：", "悬链线的曲率半径随弧长的平方", "增长，弧长自顶点起算。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:4}", "$\\gamma'(t) = e^t(\\cos t - \\sin t,\\ \\sin t + \\cos t)$，于是", "\\[", "\\langle \\gamma(t), \\gamma'(t)\\rangle = e^{2t}", "\\bigl(\\cos t(\\cos t - \\sin t) + \\sin t(\\sin t + \\cos t)\\bigr)", "= e^{2t},", "\\]", "而 $\\norm{\\gamma(t)} = e^t$，$\\norm{\\gamma'(t)} =", "e^t\\sqrt 2$。于是", "\\[", "\\cos\\angle\\bigl(\\gamma, \\gamma'\\bigr)", "= \\frac{e^{2t}}{e^t \\cdot e^t\\sqrt2} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2} :", "\\]", "切线与向径始终成 $\\pi/4$ 的夹角 --- 这是对数螺线的", "\\emph{等角}性质。弧长", "在 $(-\\infty, 0]$ 上为：", "\\[", "\\int_{-\\infty}^0 \\norm{\\gamma'(t)}\\,\\dd t", "= \\sqrt2\\int_{-\\infty}^0 e^t\\,\\dd t = \\sqrt 2 ,", "\\]", "弧长有限，尽管螺线绕", "原点旋转了无穷多圈。曲率方面，$x'y'' - y'x''$ 由 $\\gamma'' =", "e^t(-2\\sin t,\\ 2\\cos t)$，得", "\\[", "x'y'' - y'x'' = e^{2t}\\bigl(2\\cos t(\\cos t - \\sin t)", "+ 2\\sin t(\\sin t + \\cos t)\\bigr) = 2e^{2t},", "\\]", "于是 $\\kappa(t) = \\dfrac{2e^{2t}}{(e^t\\sqrt2)^3} =", "\\dfrac{1}{e^t\\sqrt2}$。曲率为 $1/(\\sqrt2\\,", "\\norm{\\gamma})$，随螺线增大而衰减。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:5}", "\\emph{第一支：}$\\gamma(t) = (t^2,\\ t^4 + t^5)$。", "在 $0$ 处，$\\gamma'' = (2, 0) \\neq 0$，故 $p = 2$。接着 $\\gamma^{(3)}(0)", "= (0, 0)$，$\\gamma^{(4)}(0) = (0, 24)$，与 $(2,", "0)$ 不共线，故 $q = 4$。两者均为偶数：\\emph{第二类尖点} --- 两支", "均沿 $+u = (1,0)$ 方向离开，", "并位于切线的同一侧。（事实上，在两支上 $y = x^2 \\pm x^{5/2}$，", "当 $x$ 充分小时符号相同。）", "", "\\emph{第二支：}$\\gamma(t) = (t^3, t^4)$。$\\gamma'(0) =", "\\gamma''(0) = 0$，$\\gamma^{(3)}(0) = (6, 0)$，故 $p = 3$，为奇数。下一步", "$\\gamma^{(4)}(0) = (0, 24)$，故 $q = 4$，为偶数。一奇一偶时", "为\\emph{普通点} --- 尽管速度为零，", "轨迹 $y = x^{4/3}$ 平滑地穿过原点，", "并保持在其切线 $y = 0$ 的上方。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:curves:6}", "对 $c(s) = \\gamma(s) + \\dfrac{1}{\\kappa(s)}N(s)$ 求导，利用", "平面弗雷内公式", "（\\cref{thm:b2:curves:frenet2d}）：", "\\[", "c'(s) = T(s) - \\frac{\\kappa'(s)}{\\kappa(s)^2}N(s)", "+ \\frac{1}{\\kappa(s)}\\,\\bigl(-\\kappa(s)T(s)\\bigr)", "= -\\frac{\\kappa'(s)}{\\kappa(s)^2}\\,N(s) ,", "\\]", "切向项恰好相消。于是渐屈线的速度", "由 $N(s)$ 承载，它指向", "$\\gamma$ 在 $\\gamma(s)$ 处的法线 --- 而点 $c(s)$ 恰位于", "该法线上：渐屈线即为\\emph{法线的包络}。", "（在 $\\kappa' = 0$ 处渐屈线有奇点，这正是", "椭圆渐屈线出现尖点的原因。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}